## 1. Quick Start

### Step 1 — Register

```http
POST https://api.metagod.in/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Arjun Sharma",
  "email": "arjun@example.com",
  "password": "Password@123",
  "phone": "9876543210"
}
```

### Step 2 — Login and store the token

```http
POST https://api.metagod.in/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "arjun@example.com",
  "password": "Password@123"
}
```

**Response:**
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "accessToken": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...",
    "refreshToken": "eyJhbGci...",
    "user": {
      "_id": "6a0dd97a...",
      "name": "Arjun Sharma",
      "email": "arjun@example.com",
      "role": "USER"
    }
  }
}
```

Store `accessToken` and `refreshToken` securely.

### Step 3 — Add token to every request

```
Authorization: Bearer <accessToken>
```

