## 3. Response Format

All API responses follow this structure:

### ✅ Success

```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": { ... }
}
```

For list responses:
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": [ ... ]
}
```

### ❌ Error

```json
{
  "success": false,
  "message": "Human-readable error description"
}
```

