## 7. Donations

Donations use **Razorpay** and require two API calls.

| Endpoint | Method | Auth | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| `/donations/create-order` | POST | ❌ | Step 1: Create Razorpay order |
| `/donations/verify-payment` | POST | ❌ | Step 2: Confirm after payment |
| `/donations/mock-save` | POST | ❌ | **DEV only** — skip Razorpay |

### Step 1 — Create Razorpay Order

```http
POST /api/donations/create-order
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "templeId": "6a0dd97a5c596419fbe2118b",
  "amount": 501,
  "donorName": "Arjun Sharma",
  "donorEmail": "arjun@example.com",
  "donorPhone": "9876543210",
  "offeringName": "Maha Aarti Contribution",
  "donationType": "cash_gift"
}
```

**Response:**
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "razorpayOrderId": "order_OBKnmLvxxxxxxx",
    "amount": 50100,
    "currency": "INR",
    "keyId": "rzp_test_xxxxxx"
  }
}
```

> ⚠️ `amount` in the response is in **paise** (501 rupees = 50100 paise). Pass this directly to the Razorpay SDK.

### Step 2 — Verify Payment (after Razorpay success callback)

```http
POST /api/donations/verify-payment
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "razorpay_order_id": "order_OBKnmLvxxxxxxx",
  "razorpay_payment_id": "pay_OBKnxxxxxx",
  "razorpay_signature": "abc123...",
  "templeId": "6a0dd97a5c596419fbe2118b",
  "amount": 501,
  "donorName": "Arjun Sharma",
  "donorEmail": "arjun@example.com",
  "donorPhone": "9876543210",
  "offeringName": "Maha Aarti Contribution",
  "donationType": "cash_gift"
}
```

### Donation Types

| `donationType` | When to use |
|---|---|
| `cash_gift` | User enters a custom donation amount |
| `shop_donation` | User donates a temple shop item |

