### Wallet Details Response

```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "balance": 850,
    "currency": "INR",
    "transactions": [
      {
        "type": "credit",
        "amount": 1000,
        "description": "Wallet Recharge",
        "createdAt": "2026-05-27T10:00:00.000Z"
      },
      {
        "type": "debit",
        "amount": 150,
        "description": "Donation to Shiv Mandir",
