## 17. Razorpay Payment Flow

Used for **Donations**, **Wallet Recharge**, and **Subscriptions**.

```
App                       Backend                   Razorpay
 │                           │                          │
 ├── POST /create-order ────>│                          │
 │                           ├── Create order ─────────>│
 │                           │<── order_id, amount ─────┤
 │<── { order_id, keyId } ───┤                          │
 │                           │                          │
 ├── Open Razorpay SDK ─────>│                          │
 │   (user completes payment)│                          │
 │<── payment_id, signature ─┤                          │
 │                           │                          │
 ├── POST /verify ──────────>│                          │
 │                           ├── Verify signature ─────>│
 │                           │<── OK ───────────────────┤
 │<── { success: true } ─────┤                          │
```

### React Native (Razorpay SDK) Example

```javascript
import RazorpayCheckout from 'react-native-razorpay';

// Step 1: call your create-order endpoint
const res = await axios.post('/api/donations/create-order', donationPayload);
const { razorpayOrderId, amount, keyId } = res.data.data;

// Step 2: open Razorpay checkout
const options = {
  description: 'Donation to Temple',
  currency: 'INR',
  key: keyId,           // from backend
  amount: amount,       // in paise — already correct from backend
  order_id: razorpayOrderId,
  name: 'Temple Project',
  prefill: {
    email: user.email,
    contact: user.phone,
    name: user.name,
  },
  theme: { color: '#D4AF37' }
};

try {
  const paymentData = await RazorpayCheckout.open(options);

  // Step 3: verify payment
  await axios.post('/api/donations/verify-payment', {
    razorpay_order_id:   paymentData.razorpay_order_id,
    razorpay_payment_id: paymentData.razorpay_payment_id,
    razorpay_signature:  paymentData.razorpay_signature,
    ...donationPayload  // include original donation fields again
  });

  alert('Donation successful! 🙏');
} catch (error) {
  if (error.code === 2) {
    console.log('Payment cancelled by user');
  } else {
    console.error('Payment failed', error);
  }
}
```

